  "title": "Savory Cheddar Zucchini Muffins",
  "description": "This breakfast-friendly savory Cheddar zucchini muffin recipe features Parmesan for extra cheesy flavor and crispy bacon for a salty, crunchy bite.",
  "authors": [
    "Pam Ziegler Lutz"
